misc_helper bundles UI component markup adapted from Penguin UI
(https://www.penguinui.com, https://github.com/SalarHoushvand/penguinui-components).

Penguin UI is licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) Salar Houshvand.

The adapted markup lives in misc_helper/templates/macros/clipboard/. It is modified from the
originals: the `dark:` colour variants are removed and the semantic colour names are re-pointed
at Frappe's frappe-ui/espresso CSS variables, so theming follows Frappe's [data-theme] switch
rather than the operating system's prefers-color-scheme.
